OL,3,GNEWSAHow long can Labour's feel-good
OL,4,Afactor last?
OL,5,
OL,6,FHow long can Labour's feel-good factor
OL,7,Flast?
OL,9,F"He just loves being prime minister," a
OL,10,Fgovernment insider observes.
OL,12,FAndy Burnham might not yet have
OL,13,Fdelivered his all-important conference
OL,14,Fspeech, but he has been preparing for
OL,15,Fthis moment for years.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
