OL,3,GNEWSAHow long can Labour's feel-good
OL,4,Afactor last?
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe'll lap up the inevitable whoops and
OL,7,Fcheers ` not just as Labour's leader,
OL,8,Fbut the kind of leader who chimes with
OL,9,Fthe party's rank and file, who puts
OL,10,Fsocial justice at the top of his list,
OL,11,Fwho is not averse to cranking up the
OL,12,Fgreatest hits ` whether taking a pop at
OL,13,FMrs Thatcher, privatisation, or the
OL,14,Fdivides between north and south.
